# The MP3 player (cavekit-flash.md R7): its play button starts the tune at the output sink, the same button pauses
# it. The corpus's tune is quiet (its peak some 1800 of 32768), so the bar is a peak of 600.
id: flash-app-mp3
section: Flash
item: A Flash app does its task, the MP3 player: silent until its play button is tapped, the tune at the output sink after, silent again when paused
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/mp3-player-multi
kit: cavekit-flash.md R7
wait rect m 40
wait still m 15
sound-watch 3000
expect sound-watched silent 600
sound-watch 8000
stage-tap m 200 20 37 10
expect sound-watched heard 600
stage-tap m 200 20 37 10
pause 1500
sound-watch 3000
expect sound-watched silent 600
